1
00:01:20,439 --> 00:01:22,280
It's clearly written in black and white.

2
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:25,560
I want a divorce.

3
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:37,439
Say it again.

4
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,480
As long as you can do it,

5
00:01:41,079 --> 00:01:41,959
the Su family

6
00:01:42,359 --> 00:01:44,120
will be safe and sound.

7
00:01:44,959 --> 00:01:45,719
I said it.

8
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Su Yuejiao,

9
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,239
you...

10
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,400
Impulsive,

11
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,079
bad-tempered,

12
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:51,760
and you hurt me when you hit me.

13
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,599
I've had enough.

14
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:54,239
I want a divorce.

15
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:00,640
Don't be silly.

16
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:02,519
Let's go home and talk about it.

17
00:02:02,519 --> 00:02:03,319
Go home?

18
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,439
That's not my home.

19
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,439
We're fake.

20
00:02:31,759 --> 00:02:32,800
All we have

21
00:02:34,039 --> 00:02:35,800
is fake.

22
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,680
It seems that you have forgotten.

23
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,159
Fine.

24
00:02:43,919 --> 00:02:45,520
I'll help you recall.

25
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:48,120
You just wanted to be the wife of the Commander,

26
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,360
and I wanted to attend the Star Conference.

27
00:02:51,879 --> 00:02:53,360
So you pretended to be my wife,

28
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,039
and I pretended to be your husband.

29
00:02:56,319 --> 00:02:57,319
From the beginning,

30
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:59,360
we were just working together.

31
00:03:05,199 --> 00:03:05,879
Anyway,

32
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,840
I will marry no one but you.

33
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,879
I like you.

34
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:12,680
Because I like you,

35
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,360
I care about

36
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,639
whether you really want to divorce me.

37
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,719
I don't want to divorce you.

38
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:27,319
I want to spend the rest of my life with you.

39
00:03:29,919 --> 00:03:31,879
What about what you said in Yun Bridge?

40
00:03:33,919 --> 00:03:35,639
You said you would marry me.

41
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,479
You said

42
00:03:37,879 --> 00:03:39,240
you would spend the rest of your life with me.

43
00:03:40,879 --> 00:03:41,960
Were those lies?

44
00:03:47,199 --> 00:03:48,080
Those were just

45
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:50,280
words to make a woman happy.

46
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:54,439
I've said that to every girl in the pleasure quarters.

47
00:03:55,039 --> 00:03:55,800
Are you

48
00:03:57,319 --> 00:03:59,439
that naive?

49
00:04:00,199 --> 00:04:01,680
Did you fall for it?

50
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,360
Yes,

51
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,639
I did.

52
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:11,879
Makes sense.

53
00:04:13,439 --> 00:04:14,639
With my talent,

54
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,680
there are so many girls who are interested in me.

55
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:19,319
But I can't marry them all.

56
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,319
My body

57
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,839
can't handle it.

58
00:04:26,879 --> 00:04:27,639
I don't believe it.

59
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,680
Did they force you to say this?

60
00:04:29,959 --> 00:04:30,879
No one forced me.

61
00:04:32,839 --> 00:04:33,639
Su Yuejiao,

62
00:04:35,079 --> 00:04:36,519
we are not the same kind of people.

63
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,519
Now I'm the top of the Xingyun List.

64
00:04:43,319 --> 00:04:44,639
Who would want to fall back

65
00:04:44,639 --> 00:04:46,120
to the bottom?

66
00:04:46,839 --> 00:04:47,759
To the agency

67
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,399
as a live-in son-in-law?

68
00:04:52,079 --> 00:04:52,959
Listen,

69
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,600
I used to need you,

70
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,519
so I let you bully me.

71
00:04:58,959 --> 00:04:59,600
But now,

72
00:05:00,079 --> 00:05:00,959
Miss Su,

73
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,800
you'd better behave yourself.

74
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:06,920
Mr. Su,

75
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:09,199
you've heard enough.

76
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,360
Guards,

77
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,000
see him out.

78
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:14,560
Thank you, Miss.

79
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,199
Cheng Qi,

80
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:16,399
I don't believe a word

81
00:05:16,399 --> 00:05:17,600
you said today.

82
00:05:18,639 --> 00:05:19,720
Come back with me.

83
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:24,160
For old times' sake,

84
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,639
I tried to reason with you.

85
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:27,439
Mr. Su,

86
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,399
since you're so ungrateful,

87
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:30,839
I have no choice.

88
00:05:32,639 --> 00:05:33,199
Xiyun,

89
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:34,800
let's go.

90
00:08:31,959 --> 00:08:32,440
Jiaojiao.

91
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,480
What's wrong?

92
00:08:33,879 --> 00:08:34,919
Have you seen Cheng Qi?

93
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,559
Jiaojiao.

94
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:38,960
Jiaojiao.

95
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,840
It seems worse than I thought.

96
00:08:52,519 --> 00:08:54,879
Let Cheng Yicheng go and find out.

97
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,480
Cheng Qi,

98
00:08:57,759 --> 00:08:59,240
Jiaojiao is so worried about him,

99
00:08:59,639 --> 00:09:01,120
but when the Escort Agency is in trouble,

100
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,840
he can't wait to find a better one.

101
00:09:03,879 --> 00:09:05,440
He's ungrateful.

102
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,759
I'm afraid

103
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,039
it's not that simple.

104
00:09:10,279 --> 00:09:11,200
It's all your fault.

105
00:09:11,399 --> 00:09:13,399
You said Cheng Qi was Jiaojiao's destiny,

106
00:09:13,399 --> 00:09:14,559
but it's a disaster.

107
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,919
I shouldn't have supported him.

108
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:35,320
I've always said that Cheng Qi

109
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,159
is no good.

110
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,879
It's a good thing he's gone.

111
00:09:39,279 --> 00:09:41,679
If it weren't for the tricks my uncle played,

112
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:43,480
my lord wouldn't have been so desperate

113
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,799
to bring in such a disaster.

114
00:09:45,639 --> 00:09:46,399
Right, right.

115
00:09:46,399 --> 00:09:47,200
It's all my fault.

116
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:49,639
Then I'll find a good match

117
00:09:49,639 --> 00:09:50,720
for your lord in the future.

118
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:51,279
Is that okay?

119
00:09:51,279 --> 00:09:52,399
Forget it.

120
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:54,279
Just let her be alone.

121
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,480
I think this time

122
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:57,840
she is hurt more

123
00:09:57,919 --> 00:09:58,879
than any other time.

124
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:57,519
She has been lying here for three days.

125
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:59,200
How can she not eat or drink?

126
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,080
I'll drag her up.

127
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:05,080
I remember

128
00:11:06,279 --> 00:11:07,639
when we had a quarrel,

129
00:11:08,039 --> 00:11:09,519
she locked herself in the room for three days,

130
00:11:10,279 --> 00:11:11,960
and then knelt in the ancestral hall all night,

131
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:13,960
and then went to escort.

132
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:15,919
How about

133
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,440
we take her to the ancestral hall?

134
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:38,279
Jiao,

135
00:11:40,519 --> 00:11:42,559
you look upset.

136
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,039
Mom,

137
00:11:48,559 --> 00:11:50,879
how could he become like this?

138
00:11:52,919 --> 00:11:57,480
I can't tell the truth

139
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,720
from the false.

140
00:12:05,399 --> 00:12:06,399
Some things

141
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,200
can't be solved by thinking.

142
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:12,000
You can't get stuck in a rut.

143
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:13,639
You have to solve it.

144
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,720
Mom,

145
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:23,759
when dad let you down,

146
00:12:24,639 --> 00:12:26,320
how did you solve it?

147
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:31,279
To be honest,

148
00:12:31,679 --> 00:12:32,679
I haven't encountered

149
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:34,080
this situation before.

150
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,039
But if it happens,

151
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:37,559
just solve it.

152
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,200
Fight with him,

153
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,240
beat him up,

154
00:12:41,759 --> 00:12:42,559
and it's done.

155
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:50,320
But if you can't bear to do that,

156
00:12:51,639 --> 00:12:53,720
just do what you should do.

157
00:12:58,279 --> 00:12:59,440
The heart of a person

158
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:03,159
is always so small.

159
00:13:04,039 --> 00:13:05,360
When someone new comes in,

160
00:13:06,039 --> 00:13:06,799
the old ones

161
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:08,600
will be pushed out.

162
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,360
Mom,

163
00:13:14,679 --> 00:13:16,639
I'm so tired.

164
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,039
I know.

165
00:13:22,639 --> 00:13:23,600
Take a nap.

166
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:27,799
When you wake up,

167
00:13:29,279 --> 00:13:30,679
everything will be fine.

168
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:05,440
Dinner's ready.

169
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:17,320
How long are you going to keep this up?

170
00:14:18,879 --> 00:14:20,000
You're the top scholar

171
00:14:20,559 --> 00:14:21,679
from the Yun State.

172
00:14:22,039 --> 00:14:23,000
I can help you

173
00:14:23,679 --> 00:14:24,440
get a position in the court.

174
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:25,279
I can give you anything you want.

175
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:26,480
I'm hungry.

176
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:27,879
I just want

177
00:14:28,559 --> 00:14:29,399
to eat now.

178
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:33,799
You said you wanted to make money

179
00:14:33,799 --> 00:14:34,679
and settle in the capital.

180
00:14:35,159 --> 00:14:36,039
Now,

181
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,559
you're living in a big house,

182
00:14:38,039 --> 00:14:39,480
surrounded by beauties,

183
00:14:39,519 --> 00:14:41,440
and having everything served on a silver platter.

184
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:43,519
This is the life of a deity.

185
00:14:47,919 --> 00:14:51,000
I want a talented and creative leader,

186
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:53,480
not a zombie-like playboy.

187
00:14:59,799 --> 00:15:00,440
Today,

188
00:15:00,799 --> 00:15:02,080
is the day to hand in the script.

189
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,600
If you can't hand it in on time,

190
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,039
the Su family...

191
00:15:16,559 --> 00:15:17,320
Here.

192
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:21,279
I told you, it's all for the sake of creation.

193
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:22,600
I didn't lie to you, did I?

194
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,279
This time, you're serious.

195
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,720
Can you let him go?

196
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:04,000
It's just a few months.

197
00:16:04,679 --> 00:16:05,879
With my brain,

198
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:07,080
I'll forget him soon.

199
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:13,600
Good.

200
00:16:14,559 --> 00:16:16,759
You're the master now.

201
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:18,519
Find a better one.

202
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:31,279
Did Ling Chen write all these?

203
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:32,480
Yes.

204
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:33,919
The others who wrote for him

205
00:16:34,399 --> 00:16:35,200
have been dealt with.

206
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:40,320
I'll tell the emperor

207
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:42,559
that I'm the one who changed the winner.

208
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:45,000
It was my fault.

209
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:46,759
I almost ruined your plan.

210
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:49,799
Thankfully, you dealt with it in time.

211
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:53,519
But we can't keep Cheng Qi

212
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,759
shouldn't be kept in the open.

213
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:57,720
Just use his talents.

214
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:06,839
What?

215
00:17:08,119 --> 00:17:09,519
He's moved into your residence?

216
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,279
If you find it inappropriate,

217
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:14,079
I'll find another place.

218
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:17,039
Keep him if you like.

219
00:17:17,359 --> 00:17:18,720
He's just a dog.

220
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:21,559
But if necessary,

221
00:17:21,839 --> 00:17:23,160
you must be ruthless

222
00:17:23,839 --> 00:17:25,119
in ending the relationship.

223
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:26,400
Yes.

224
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:27,599
Father, please rest assured.

225
00:18:08,319 --> 00:18:09,319
He's gone,

226
00:18:09,839 --> 00:18:11,039
and he's not coming back.

227
00:18:11,839 --> 00:18:13,039
Su Yuejiao,

228
00:18:13,559 --> 00:18:14,640
just let go of him.

229
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:28,880
A lot of people are saying we're stealing from ourselves.

230
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:31,039
All the merchants in Yunxing City

231
00:18:32,440 --> 00:18:33,759
have been taken by Fu Xiang.

232
00:18:36,640 --> 00:18:37,440
What's left

233
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:39,079
are just small orders.

234
00:18:39,359 --> 00:18:40,160
Gong Xi and I

235
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:41,519
delivered them all in half a day.

236
00:18:44,359 --> 00:18:45,880
There are only a few short-distance deliveries out of town.

237
00:18:46,279 --> 00:18:47,640
All relying on regular customers.

238
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:52,039
The situation is worse than I expected.

239
00:18:52,559 --> 00:18:53,680
But don't worry.

240
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:54,680
I'll figure it out.

241
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:55,720
What method?

242
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:02,279
I haven't thought of it yet.

243
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:11,720
If he were here, he would have a solution.

244
00:19:27,519 --> 00:19:28,599
Put it there.

245
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:29,559
By the way,

246
00:19:30,039 --> 00:19:31,480
bring me some more wine.

247
00:19:34,359 --> 00:19:35,720
My Lord, it's me.

248
00:19:40,079 --> 00:19:41,480
What are you doing here?

249
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:46,720
Have you found a new beauty?

250
00:19:50,559 --> 00:19:52,880
I found them according to your preferences.

251
00:19:53,839 --> 00:19:54,680
Come on.

252
00:19:57,759 --> 00:19:58,680
How's the escort agency?

253
00:19:58,880 --> 00:19:59,880
After my Lady went back,

254
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:01,279
for three days.

255
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:03,720
She's out these days.

256
00:20:04,480 --> 00:20:06,319
But the agency has no business.

257
00:20:06,799 --> 00:20:07,680
Gong Xi and Facha

258
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:09,400
come to the Moon God Pavilion to work every day.

259
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:13,079
She must be holding on.

260
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:14,519
No.

261
00:20:15,119 --> 00:20:16,319
I have to find a way

262
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:17,400
to get out of here.

263
00:20:18,599 --> 00:20:19,039
By the way,

264
00:20:19,279 --> 00:20:21,240
did you send the news that I'm messing around to Ning'an?

265
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:22,119
Rest assured, my lord.

266
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:24,519
It's very disgusting.

267
00:20:24,559 --> 00:20:25,319
That's good.

268
00:20:26,039 --> 00:20:27,200
The more disgusting it is,

269
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:28,599
the sooner my father will come.

270
00:20:29,079 --> 00:20:29,799
Remember to

271
00:20:30,079 --> 00:20:31,240
meet my father at the city gate.

272
00:20:31,519 --> 00:20:32,440
Don't go to the wrong place.

273
00:20:34,319 --> 00:20:36,200
I haven't bathed for several days.

274
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:37,400
Look,

275
00:20:37,759 --> 00:20:39,240
I'm almost covered with mushrooms.

276
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:41,119
You don't have to pretend to this extent.

277
00:20:41,799 --> 00:20:42,839
Are you stupid?

278
00:20:43,079 --> 00:20:43,920
If I don't do this,

279
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:46,480
I will be eaten up by Zhang Xi Yun.

280
00:20:47,319 --> 00:20:48,920
It's really tiring to be a playboy.

281
00:20:49,200 --> 00:20:50,680
I'm drinking so much that my liver hurts.

282
00:20:51,279 --> 00:20:52,599
I'd rather be beaten by my wife.

283
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:53,759
My Lord

284
00:20:54,519 --> 00:20:55,920
Can we go back to the Escort Agency?

285
00:21:00,480 --> 00:21:01,359
As long as I'm alive,

286
00:21:04,759 --> 00:21:06,319
I must go back to find her.

287
00:21:23,480 --> 00:21:25,960
Cheng Qi fell seriously ill.

288
00:21:27,759 --> 00:21:31,000
He offered to step down as the top scholar.

289
00:21:32,160 --> 00:21:33,599
I'm worried

290
00:21:34,039 --> 00:21:35,279
that the Poetry Meeting will be delayed.

291
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:40,720
I remember Cheng Qi is quite young.

292
00:21:41,279 --> 00:21:43,559
There's no plague in the capital.

293
00:21:44,160 --> 00:21:45,480
What's going on?

294
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:48,359
He's a free spirit,

295
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:49,519
living on his own terms.

296
00:21:50,559 --> 00:21:52,160
I didn't want to pry.

297
00:21:52,599 --> 00:21:53,960
What's the illness?

298
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:56,680
Your Majesty is busy with state affairs.

299
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:59,480
This trivial matter shouldn't bother you.

300
00:22:01,519 --> 00:22:03,200
How is the new champion

301
00:22:03,359 --> 00:22:04,200
doing?

302
00:22:04,599 --> 00:22:07,799
I've assigned him to draft the speech.

303
00:22:10,160 --> 00:22:11,400
Please review it.

304
00:22:21,160 --> 00:22:23,000
You're truly a lifesaver.

305
00:22:25,359 --> 00:22:26,480
The speech contest

306
00:22:26,839 --> 00:22:28,039
will be your responsibility.

307
00:22:28,160 --> 00:22:29,279
Is it settled?

308
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:30,319
Yes, sir.

309
00:22:30,319 --> 00:22:30,880
Lord Yue,

310
00:22:31,519 --> 00:22:33,000
assist the Grand Preceptor well.

311
00:22:34,559 --> 00:22:36,039
Yes, Your Majesty.

312
00:22:59,599 --> 00:23:01,799
Do you need escort?

313
00:23:02,720 --> 00:23:04,640
Call your chief escort over.

314
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:06,680
I'm Su Yuejiao,

315
00:23:06,839 --> 00:23:08,839
the chief escort of Su's Escort Agency.

316
00:23:09,880 --> 00:23:11,400
You're the chief escort?

317
00:23:13,319 --> 00:23:15,519
You're so young and a woman.

318
00:23:17,640 --> 00:23:19,640
I don't think your agency is reliable.

319
00:23:32,279 --> 00:23:33,400
Su's Escort Agency

320
00:23:33,519 --> 00:23:34,400
will deliver the goods.

321
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:35,440
I'll give it a try.

322
00:23:39,839 --> 00:23:41,240
Good kung fu.

323
00:23:42,240 --> 00:23:42,920
I'll hire you.

324
00:23:43,519 --> 00:23:44,920
You'll get your share of the reward.

325
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:48,880
Kala Town.

326
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:50,480
I can't go there.

327
00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:52,680
It's a rule set by my mother.

328
00:23:52,799 --> 00:23:53,920
Kala Town is too far away.

329
00:23:54,079 --> 00:23:55,079
It will take at least

330
00:23:55,240 --> 00:23:56,720
half a month to go there and back.

331
00:23:56,720 --> 00:23:57,880
And it's on the border of Langyue.

332
00:23:58,240 --> 00:23:59,839
But we need the money.

333
00:24:00,039 --> 00:24:01,240
How much did he offer?

334
00:24:01,240 --> 00:24:02,200
It doesn't matter.

335
00:24:03,240 --> 00:24:04,279
Do you remember

336
00:24:04,640 --> 00:24:05,839
how long we were pursued

337
00:24:05,839 --> 00:24:06,920
after escorting to Klak City?

338
00:24:07,480 --> 00:24:08,480
Anyway, we can't go.

339
00:24:09,200 --> 00:24:12,000
Dad and Mom were injured for justice.

340
00:24:12,440 --> 00:24:13,839
And the money earned from this escort

341
00:24:14,079 --> 00:24:15,640
can support the Escort Agency for half a year.

342
00:24:15,839 --> 00:24:16,599
So much?

343
00:24:17,119 --> 00:24:18,119
What are they transporting?

344
00:24:21,039 --> 00:24:23,200
Some treasures purchased in the Yun State.

345
00:24:23,319 --> 00:24:25,440
My Lord, is this a scam?

346
00:24:26,319 --> 00:24:28,039
Or I'll go with you.

347
00:24:29,039 --> 00:24:30,039
I'll protect you.

348
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:32,319
You are the biggest danger when there is no danger.

349
00:24:32,319 --> 00:24:32,920
No.

350
00:24:34,119 --> 00:24:36,839
I just want to do something for the Agency.

351
00:24:37,599 --> 00:24:38,519
No one is allowed to go.

352
00:24:39,519 --> 00:24:40,599
Stop arguing.

353
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:43,319
Don't tell Grandpa about this.

354
00:24:43,559 --> 00:24:44,599
Or he will worry about me.

355
00:24:47,480 --> 00:24:48,480
You should go back first.

356
00:25:18,319 --> 00:25:18,799
My Lord,

357
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:19,599
this is the place.

358
00:25:19,920 --> 00:25:21,680
He's been indulging in debauchery

359
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:22,640
and revelry in there.

360
00:25:22,920 --> 00:25:24,319
That brat!

361
00:25:24,680 --> 00:25:26,319
I thought he'd settle down

362
00:25:26,319 --> 00:25:27,319
after getting married.

363
00:25:27,839 --> 00:25:30,640
But he has gone further!

364
00:25:33,559 --> 00:25:34,880
Who dares to break into the Prime Minister's Garden?

365
00:25:35,240 --> 00:25:36,799
Call Cheng Qi out!

366
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:37,880
I'm his father!

367
00:25:39,240 --> 00:25:40,839
Cheng Qi, get out!

368
00:25:40,839 --> 00:25:42,799
Get out! Get out!

369
00:25:45,799 --> 00:25:47,079
You don't let me in, right?

370
00:25:48,200 --> 00:25:48,799
You!

371
00:25:49,039 --> 00:25:49,640
You!

372
00:25:50,279 --> 00:25:51,200
And you!

373
00:25:52,240 --> 00:25:53,000
Cheng Yicheng!

374
00:25:53,079 --> 00:25:53,680
My Lord!

375
00:25:54,920 --> 00:25:55,319
Retreat!

376
00:25:56,079 --> 00:25:56,640
Retreat!

377
00:26:51,440 --> 00:26:53,240
Don't mess with these things anymore.

378
00:26:53,720 --> 00:26:54,839
They're useless.

379
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:57,160
What do you know?

380
00:26:58,359 --> 00:27:00,079
It's meant to be a brake.

381
00:27:00,240 --> 00:27:01,599
It can control the speed of the carriage.

382
00:27:01,759 --> 00:27:02,920
If it wasn't broken,

383
00:27:03,079 --> 00:27:04,519
the carriage wouldn't be able to move.

384
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:06,599
Don't you know how strong she is?

385
00:27:07,079 --> 00:27:08,880
Now she's gone, what are we gonna do?

386
00:27:10,559 --> 00:27:12,680
What are you arguing about in the morning?

387
00:27:16,440 --> 00:27:18,400
Where did Jiaojiao go?

388
00:27:52,440 --> 00:27:53,640
15 years ago,

389
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:55,839
I said you were a glory seeker.

390
00:27:56,319 --> 00:27:58,039
I was too shallow back then.

391
00:27:58,160 --> 00:28:00,119
This drink is my apology to you.

392
00:28:02,480 --> 00:28:04,920
That's not what you said back then.

393
00:28:05,559 --> 00:28:07,839
You said I was just a brown-noser.

394
00:28:13,519 --> 00:28:14,480
At the last autumn hunt,

395
00:28:14,480 --> 00:28:16,319
my horse wasn't spooked.

396
00:28:16,839 --> 00:28:18,680
This drink is to make amends.

397
00:28:19,400 --> 00:28:20,519
I knew it!

398
00:28:21,000 --> 00:28:23,440
You just wanted to see me fall

399
00:28:23,440 --> 00:28:26,119
in front of everyone, didn't you?

400
00:28:33,039 --> 00:28:35,440
Warriors are no match for scholars.

401
00:28:42,960 --> 00:28:43,599
Enough.

402
00:28:44,359 --> 00:28:44,920
Just tell me,

403
00:28:45,279 --> 00:28:46,920
what do you need from me?

404
00:28:46,920 --> 00:28:49,039
You must know about the Star Conference.

405
00:28:52,559 --> 00:28:53,319
Don't mention it.

406
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:57,240
Your son is well-read

407
00:28:57,519 --> 00:28:58,559
and talented.

408
00:29:00,400 --> 00:29:04,400
But he doesn't look like your son.

409
00:29:09,640 --> 00:29:10,640
I heard

410
00:29:11,279 --> 00:29:12,559
Cheng Qi is seriously ill.

411
00:29:12,920 --> 00:29:14,680
I thought he had returned to Ning'an.

412
00:29:14,920 --> 00:29:16,200
What happened?

413
00:29:16,319 --> 00:29:17,079
Yicheng.

414
00:29:20,440 --> 00:29:21,400
Lord Yue.

415
00:29:22,519 --> 00:29:25,160
What happened to Cheng Qi?

416
00:29:25,920 --> 00:29:27,960
After being invited to the Grand Preceptor's villa,

417
00:29:28,039 --> 00:29:29,160
he never came out.

418
00:29:30,039 --> 00:29:31,559
What was he doing there?

419
00:29:31,920 --> 00:29:34,640
Drinking, listening to music, watching dances.

420
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:36,279
Just like before in Ning'an.

421
00:29:36,559 --> 00:29:38,799
So he's not sick at all.

422
00:29:40,759 --> 00:29:43,319
How dare the Grand Preceptor deceive the royal family?

423
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:46,200
What about his wife?

424
00:29:46,440 --> 00:29:48,160
Can she allow him to stay out all night?

425
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:49,920
Lady Yan went to see him earlier.

426
00:29:50,240 --> 00:29:51,440
He said he wanted to divorce.

427
00:29:51,920 --> 00:29:53,240
I didn't go back to the escort agency.

428
00:29:53,359 --> 00:29:54,240
I don't know the details.

429
00:29:54,640 --> 00:29:55,480
Escort agency?

430
00:29:55,759 --> 00:29:57,599
What... what divorce?

431
00:29:59,319 --> 00:30:01,279
It's not that simple.

432
00:30:01,519 --> 00:30:02,920
Is it that the Grand Preceptor

433
00:30:03,200 --> 00:30:06,559
threatened to use Su Biaotou and the escort agency

434
00:30:06,960 --> 00:30:08,119
to put Cheng Qi under house arrest?

435
00:30:09,799 --> 00:30:10,759
Su Biaotou,

436
00:30:11,480 --> 00:30:12,799
I'm confused.

437
00:30:13,720 --> 00:30:16,920
The poem the Grand Preceptor presented to the Emperor

438
00:30:17,000 --> 00:30:18,920
was somewhat like Cheng Qi's style.

439
00:30:19,960 --> 00:30:22,200
Is he detaining Cheng Qi

440
00:30:22,279 --> 00:30:24,200
to make him write for someone else?

441
00:30:28,519 --> 00:30:29,480
What do you mean by write for someone else?

442
00:30:31,319 --> 00:30:32,119
After all these years,

443
00:30:32,119 --> 00:30:33,720
can't you read more?

444
00:30:34,599 --> 00:30:35,400
It's like

445
00:30:35,559 --> 00:30:36,599
someone forcing you

446
00:30:36,880 --> 00:30:37,640
to use my name

447
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:38,920
to make you

448
00:30:39,480 --> 00:30:41,839
to please the enemy.

449
00:30:42,759 --> 00:30:44,400
They are simply bullying me too much.

450
00:30:44,759 --> 00:30:46,599
I'll risk my life...

451
00:30:46,720 --> 00:30:47,559
Enough.

452
00:30:47,559 --> 00:30:49,279
You can go in, but you come to me.

453
00:30:49,880 --> 00:30:51,480
Don't you just want me to save him?

454
00:30:55,039 --> 00:30:56,000
Can you save him?

455
00:30:57,440 --> 00:30:57,960
Yes.

456
00:30:59,160 --> 00:30:59,880
What are the conditions?

457
00:31:03,759 --> 00:31:04,680
Three kowtows.

458
00:31:05,720 --> 00:31:06,720
I'll kowtow for the master.

459
00:31:11,960 --> 00:31:13,119
Enough.

460
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:14,359
You really kneel.

461
00:31:14,519 --> 00:31:15,200
Sit.

462
00:31:15,480 --> 00:31:15,960
I'll save him.

463
00:31:16,680 --> 00:31:17,240
I'll save him.

464
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:17,799
Sit.

465
00:31:20,519 --> 00:31:21,960
You old thing.

466
00:31:22,680 --> 00:31:24,519
We haven't seen each other for years.

467
00:31:24,759 --> 00:31:26,200
You've learned to be

468
00:31:26,200 --> 00:31:27,200
much slicker.

469
00:31:28,920 --> 00:31:30,519
But don't worry.

470
00:31:30,759 --> 00:31:33,000
The royal family cherishes talents.

471
00:31:33,359 --> 00:31:36,000
We highly value your son.

472
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:38,000
You're just in time.

473
00:31:38,359 --> 00:31:39,839
Get changed,

474
00:31:40,160 --> 00:31:41,319
and come to the palace with me.

475
00:31:41,440 --> 00:31:42,000
Good.

476
00:31:42,920 --> 00:31:43,839
Let's drink.

477
00:31:44,240 --> 00:31:44,599
Cheers.

478
00:32:27,799 --> 00:32:28,960
I intended to save you,

479
00:32:29,359 --> 00:32:30,160
but Cheng Qi didn't allow it.

480
00:32:30,799 --> 00:32:31,839
I got you into this trouble.

481
00:32:32,440 --> 00:32:33,119
I'm sorry.

482
00:32:35,599 --> 00:32:36,519
It's too late

483
00:32:36,839 --> 00:32:37,880
to say sorry.

484
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:41,400
Don't hurt people in the future.

485
00:32:41,759 --> 00:32:43,880
Don't waste the life my mother sacrificed for you.

486
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:48,440
My Lord,

487
00:32:48,559 --> 00:32:49,839
you misunderstood him.

488
00:32:50,279 --> 00:32:52,079
We only rob the rich and cruel,

489
00:32:52,279 --> 00:32:53,519
and never kill anyone.

490
00:32:53,640 --> 00:32:54,240
Shut up.

491
00:32:54,640 --> 00:32:55,920
No matter who you rob,

492
00:32:56,119 --> 00:32:58,119
robbing escorts is not justice.

493
00:32:58,559 --> 00:32:59,400
You're right.

494
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:01,079
We were wrong.

495
00:33:02,319 --> 00:33:03,079
You can go.

496
00:33:03,359 --> 00:33:04,279
I'll pretend I didn't see anything.

497
00:33:05,319 --> 00:33:06,599
If you get caught by the government,

498
00:33:07,720 --> 00:33:08,640
no one can help you.

499
00:33:12,319 --> 00:33:13,440
I heard you got divorced.

500
00:33:15,839 --> 00:33:16,680
It's none of your business.

501
00:33:18,119 --> 00:33:18,960
I have a long way to go.

502
00:33:19,200 --> 00:33:19,880
Goodbye.

503
00:33:30,000 --> 00:33:31,960
My Lord, you've been waiting for so many days,

504
00:33:32,200 --> 00:33:33,720
just to say these few words?

505
00:33:34,559 --> 00:33:35,359
Follow the escort team.
